B.amx=new A.nX(B.iQ,"40 min  \xb7  Refractory \u2014 consider intubation","Midazolam infusion (after bolus 0.2 mg/kg) \u2014 start 1 \xb5g/kg/min, titrate. OR Pentobarbital 5 mg/kg load \u2192 1\u20133 mg/kg/h. OR Propofol 1\u20132 mg/kg load \u2192 1\u20134 mg/kg/h (watch for PRIS). Continuous EEG monitoring.",null)
